{"n":68,"name":"Al-Qalam","nameAr":"القلم","meaning":"The Pen","ayahs":52,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":29,"ar":"نٓ ۚ وَٱلْقَلَمِ وَمَا يَسْطُرُونَ","en":"Nūn. By the pen and what they inscribe,","w":[{"ar":"نٓ ۚ","tr":"noon","en":"Nun"},{"ar":"وَٱلْقَلَمِ","tr":"wal-qalami","en":"By the pen","root":"قلم","lem":"قَلَم"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"يَسْطُرُونَ","tr":"yasṭurūna","en":"they write","root":"سطر","lem":"يَسْطُرُ"}]},{"n":2,"juz":29,"ar":"مَآ أَنتَ بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ بِمَجْنُونٍ","en":"You are not, [O Muḥammad], by the favor of your Lord, a madman.","w":[{"ar":"مَآ","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"أَنتَ","tr":"anta","en":"you (are)"},{"ar":"بِنِعْمَةِ","tr":"biniʿ'mati","en":"by (the) Grace","root":"نعم","lem":"نِعْمَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","tr":"bimajnūnin","en":"a madman","root":"جنن","lem":"مَجْنُون"}]},{"n":3,"juz":29,"ar":"وَإِنَّ لَكَ لَأَجْرًا غَيْرَ مَمْنُونٍ","en":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِنَّ","tr":"wa-inna","en":"And indeed"},{"ar":"لَكَ","tr":"laka","en":"for you"},{"ar":"لَأَجْرًا","tr":"la-ajran","en":"surely (is) a reward","root":"أجر","lem":"أَجْر"},{"ar":"غَيْرَ","tr":"ghayra","en":"without","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"مَمْنُونٍۢ","tr":"mamnūnin","en":"end","root":"منن","lem":"مَمْنُون"}]},{"n":4,"juz":29,"ar":"وَإِنَّكَ لَعَلَىٰ خُلُقٍ عَظِيمٍ","en":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِنَّكَ","tr":"wa-innaka","en":"And indeed, you"},{"ar":"لَعَلَىٰ","tr":"laʿalā","en":"surely (are)"},{"ar":"خُلُقٍ","tr":"khuluqin","en":"(of) a moral character","root":"خلق","lem":"خُلُق"},{"ar":"عَظِيمٍۢ","tr":"ʿaẓīmin","en":"great","root":"عظم","lem":"عَظِيم"}]},{"n":5,"juz":29,"ar":"فَسَتُبْصِرُ وَيُبْصِرُونَ","en":"So you will see and they will see.","w":[{"ar":"فَسَتُبْصِرُ","tr":"fasatub'ṣiru","en":"So you will see","root":"بصر","lem":"أَبْصَرَ"},{"ar":"وَيُبْصِرُونَ","tr":"wayub'ṣirūna","en":"and they will see","root":"بصر","lem":"أَبْصَرَ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":29,"ar":"بِأَييِّكُمُ ٱلْمَفْتُونُ","en":"Which of you is the afflicted [by a devil].","w":[{"ar":"بِأَييِّكُمُ","tr":"bi-ayyikumu","en":"Which of you","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَفْتُونُ","tr":"l-maftūnu","en":"(is) the afflicted one","root":"فتن","lem":"مَفْتُون"}]},{"n":7,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِمَن ضَلَّ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦ وَهُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","en":"Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"رَبَّكَ","tr":"rabbaka","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He"},{"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","tr":"aʿlamu","en":"(is) most knowing","root":"علم","lem":"أَعْلَم"},{"ar":"بِمَن","tr":"biman","en":"of (he) who"},{"ar":"ضَلَّ","tr":"ḍalla","en":"has strayed","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضَلَّ"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"سَبِيلِهِۦ","tr":"sabīlihi","en":"His way","root":"سبل","lem":"سَبِيل"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"and He"},{"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","tr":"aʿlamu","en":"(is) most knowing","root":"علم","lem":"أَعْلَم"},{"ar":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","tr":"bil-muh'tadīna","en":"of the guided ones","root":"هدي","lem":"مُهْتَدي"}]},{"n":8,"juz":29,"ar":"فَلَا تُطِعِ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"Then do not obey the deniers.","w":[{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"So (do) not"},{"ar":"تُطِعِ","tr":"tuṭiʿi","en":"obey","root":"طوع","lem":"أَطاعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","tr":"l-mukadhibīna","en":"the deniers","root":"كذب","lem":"مُكَذِّب"}]},{"n":9,"juz":29,"ar":"وَدُّوا۟ لَوْ تُدْهِنُ فَيُدْهِنُونَ","en":"They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].","w":[{"ar":"وَدُّوا۟","tr":"waddū","en":"They wish","root":"ودد","lem":"وَدَّ"},{"ar":"لَوْ","tr":"law","en":"that"},{"ar":"تُدْهِنُ","tr":"tud'hinu","en":"you should compromise","root":"دهن","lem":"يُدْهِنُ"},{"ar":"فَيُدْهِنُونَ","tr":"fayud'hinūna","en":"so they would compromise","root":"دهن","lem":"يُدْهِنُ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":29,"ar":"وَلَا تُطِعْ كُلَّ حَلَّافٍ مَّهِينٍ","en":"And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer","w":[{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"And (do) not"},{"ar":"تُطِعْ","tr":"tuṭiʿ","en":"obey","root":"طوع","lem":"أَطاعَ"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"حَلَّافٍۢ","tr":"ḥallāfin","en":"habitual swearer","root":"حلف","lem":"حَلّاف"},{"ar":"مَّهِينٍ","tr":"mahīnin","en":"worthless","root":"مهن","lem":"مَهِين"}]},{"n":11,"juz":29,"ar":"هَمَّازٍ مَّشَّآءٍۭ بِنَمِيمٍ","en":"[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -","w":[{"ar":"هَمَّازٍۢ","tr":"hammāzin","en":"Defamer","root":"همز","lem":"هَمّاز"},{"ar":"مَّشَّآءٍۭ","tr":"mashāin","en":"going about","root":"مشي","lem":"مَشّاء"},{"ar":"بِنَمِيمٍۢ","tr":"binamīmin","en":"with malicious gossip","root":"نمم","lem":"نَمِيم"}]},{"n":12,"juz":29,"ar":"مَّنَّاعٍ لِّلْخَيْرِ مُعْتَدٍ أَثِيمٍ","en":"A preventer of good, transgressing and sinful,","w":[{"ar":"مَّنَّاعٍۢ","tr":"mannāʿin","en":"A preventer","root":"منع","lem":"مَنّاع"},{"ar":"لِّلْخَيْرِ","tr":"lil'khayri","en":"of (the) good","root":"خير","lem":"خَيْر"},{"ar":"مُعْتَدٍ","tr":"muʿ'tadin","en":"transgressor","root":"عدو","lem":"مُعْتَد"},{"ar":"أَثِيمٍ","tr":"athīmin","en":"sinful","root":"أثم","lem":"أَثِيم"}]},{"n":13,"juz":29,"ar":"عُتُلٍّۭ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ زَنِيمٍ","en":"Cruel, moreover, and an illegitimate pretender.","w":[{"ar":"عُتُلٍّۭ","tr":"ʿutullin","en":"Cruel","root":"عتل","lem":"عُتُلّ"},{"ar":"بَعْدَ","tr":"baʿda","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"(all) that"},{"ar":"زَنِيمٍ","tr":"zanīmin","en":"utterly useless","root":"زنم","lem":"زَنِيم"}]},{"n":14,"juz":29,"ar":"أَن كَانَ ذَا مَالٍ وَبَنِينَ","en":"Because he is a possessor of wealth and children,","w":[{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"Because"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"(he) is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"ذَا","tr":"dhā","en":"a possessor"},{"ar":"مَالٍۢ","tr":"mālin","en":"(of) wealth","root":"مول","lem":"مال"},{"ar":"وَبَنِينَ","tr":"wabanīna","en":"and children","root":"بني","lem":"بُنَىّ"}]},{"n":15,"juz":29,"ar":"إِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَـٰتُنَا قَالَ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","w":[{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","tr":"tut'lā","en":"are recited","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"to him"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","tr":"āyātunā","en":"Our Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"قَالَ","tr":"qāla","en":"he says","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"أَسَـٰطِيرُ","tr":"asāṭīru","en":"Stories","root":"سطر","lem":"أَساطِير"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","tr":"l-awalīna","en":"(of) the former (people)","root":"أول","lem":"أَوَّل"}]},{"n":16,"juz":29,"ar":"سَنَسِمُهُۥ عَلَى ٱلْخُرْطُومِ","en":"We will brand him upon the snout.","w":[{"ar":"سَنَسِمُهُۥ","tr":"sanasimuhu","en":"We will brand him","root":"وسم","lem":"نَسِمُ"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"ٱلْخُرْطُومِ","tr":"l-khur'ṭūmi","en":"the snout","root":"خرطم","lem":"خُرْطُوم"}]},{"n":17,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنَّا بَلَوْنَـٰهُمْ كَمَا بَلَوْنَآ أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلْجَنَّةِ إِذْ أَقْسَمُوا۟ لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا مُصْبِحِينَ","en":"Indeed, We have tried them as We tried the companions of the garden, when they swore to cut its fruit in the [early] morning","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"بَلَوْنَـٰهُمْ","tr":"balawnāhum","en":"have tried them","root":"بلو","lem":"بَلَوْ"},{"ar":"كَمَا","tr":"kamā","en":"as"},{"ar":"بَلَوْنَآ","tr":"balawnā","en":"We tried","root":"بلو","lem":"بَلَوْ"},{"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","tr":"aṣḥāba","en":"(the) companions","root":"صحب","lem":"أَصْحاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","tr":"l-janati","en":"(of) the garden","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"إِذْ","tr":"idh","en":"when"},{"ar":"أَقْسَمُوا۟","tr":"aqsamū","en":"they swore","root":"قسم","lem":"أَقْسَمُ"},{"ar":"لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا","tr":"layaṣrimunnahā","en":"to pluck its fruit","root":"صرم","lem":"يَصْرِمُ"},{"ar":"مُصْبِحِينَ","tr":"muṣ'biḥīna","en":"(in the) morning","root":"صبح","lem":"مُصْبِح"}]},{"n":18,"juz":29,"ar":"وَلَا يَسْتَثْنُونَ","en":"Without making exception.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"يَسْتَثْنُونَ","tr":"yastathnūna","en":"making exception","root":"ثني","lem":"يَسْتَثْنُ"}]},{"n":19,"juz":29,"ar":"فَطَافَ عَلَيْهَا طَآئِفٌ مِّن رَّبِّكَ وَهُمْ نَآئِمُونَ","en":"So there came upon it [i.e., the garden] an affliction from your Lord while they were asleep.","w":[{"ar":"فَطَافَ","tr":"faṭāfa","en":"So there came","root":"طوف","lem":"طافَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","tr":"ʿalayhā","en":"upon it"},{"ar":"طَآئِفٌۭ","tr":"ṭāifun","en":"a visitation","root":"طوف","lem":"طائِف"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَهُمْ","tr":"wahum","en":"while they"},{"ar":"نَآئِمُونَ","tr":"nāimūna","en":"were asleep","root":"نوم","lem":"نائِم"}]},{"n":20,"juz":29,"ar":"فَأَصْبَحَتْ كَٱلصَّرِيمِ","en":"And it became as though reaped.","w":[{"ar":"فَأَصْبَحَتْ","tr":"fa-aṣbaḥat","en":"So it became","root":"صبح","lem":"أَصْبَحَ"},{"ar":"كَٱلصَّرِيمِ","tr":"kal-ṣarīmi","en":"as if reaped","root":"صرم","lem":"صَرِيم"}]},{"n":21,"juz":29,"ar":"فَتَنَادَوْا۟ مُصْبِحِينَ","en":"And they called one another at morning,","w":[{"ar":"فَتَنَادَوْا۟","tr":"fatanādaw","en":"And they called one another","root":"ندي","lem":"تَنادَ"},{"ar":"مُصْبِحِينَ","tr":"muṣ'biḥīna","en":"(at) morning","root":"صبح","lem":"مُصْبِح"}]},{"n":22,"juz":29,"ar":"أَنِ ٱغْدُوا۟ عَلَىٰ حَرْثِكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰرِمِينَ","en":"[Saying], \"Go early to your crop if you would cut the fruit.\"","w":[{"ar":"أَنِ","tr":"ani","en":"That"},{"ar":"ٱغْدُوا۟","tr":"igh'dū","en":"Go early","root":"غدو","lem":"غَدَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"to"},{"ar":"حَرْثِكُمْ","tr":"ḥarthikum","en":"your crop","root":"حرث","lem":"حَرْث"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"كُنتُمْ","tr":"kuntum","en":"you would","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰرِمِينَ","tr":"ṣārimīna","en":"pluck (the) fruit","root":"صرم","lem":"صارِم"}]},{"n":23,"juz":29,"ar":"فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟ وَهُمْ يَتَخَـٰفَتُونَ","en":"So they set out, while lowering their voices,","w":[{"ar":"فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟","tr":"fa-inṭalaqū","en":"So they went","root":"طلق","lem":"انطَلَقَ"},{"ar":"وَهُمْ","tr":"wahum","en":"while they"},{"ar":"يَتَخَـٰفَتُونَ","tr":"yatakhāfatūna","en":"lowered (their) voices","root":"خفت","lem":"يَتَخافَتُ"}]},{"n":24,"juz":29,"ar":"أَن لَّا يَدْخُلَنَّهَا ٱلْيَوْمَ عَلَيْكُم مِّسْكِينٌ","en":"[Saying], \"There will surely not enter it today upon you [any] poor person.\"","w":[{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"That"},{"ar":"لَّا","tr":"lā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"يَدْخُلَنَّهَا","tr":"yadkhulannahā","en":"will enter it","root":"دخل","lem":"دَخَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","tr":"l-yawma","en":"today","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","tr":"ʿalaykum","en":"upon you"},{"ar":"مِّسْكِينٌۭ","tr":"mis'kīnun","en":"any poor person","root":"سكن","lem":"مِسْكِين"}]},{"n":25,"juz":29,"ar":"وَغَدَوْا۟ عَلَىٰ حَرْدٍ قَـٰدِرِينَ","en":"And they went early in determination, [assuming themselves] able.","w":[{"ar":"وَغَدَوْا۟","tr":"waghadaw","en":"And they went early","root":"غدو","lem":"غَدَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"with"},{"ar":"حَرْدٍۢ","tr":"ḥardin","en":"determination","root":"حرد","lem":"حَرْد"},{"ar":"قَـٰدِرِينَ","tr":"qādirīna","en":"able","root":"قدر","lem":"قادِر"}]},{"n":26,"juz":29,"ar":"فَلَمَّا رَأَوْهَا قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا لَضَآلُّونَ","en":"But when they saw it, they said, \"Indeed, we are lost;","w":[{"ar":"فَلَمَّا","tr":"falammā","en":"But when"},{"ar":"رَأَوْهَا","tr":"ra-awhā","en":"they saw it","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"they said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, we"},{"ar":"لَضَآلُّونَ","tr":"laḍāllūna","en":"(are) surely lost","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضالّ"}]},{"n":27,"juz":29,"ar":"بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ","en":"Rather, we have been deprived.\"","w":[{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"نَحْنُ","tr":"naḥnu","en":"We"},{"ar":"مَحْرُومُونَ","tr":"maḥrūmūna","en":"(are) deprived","root":"حرم","lem":"مَحْرُوم"}]},{"n":28,"juz":29,"ar":"قَالَ أَوْسَطُهُمْ أَلَمْ أَقُل لَّكُمْ لَوْلَا تُسَبِّحُونَ","en":"The most moderate of them said, \"Did I not say to you, 'Why do you not exalt [Allāh]?'\"","w":[{"ar":"قَالَ","tr":"qāla","en":"Said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"أَوْسَطُهُمْ","tr":"awsaṭuhum","en":"(the) most moderate of them","root":"وسط","lem":"أَوْسَط"},{"ar":"أَلَمْ","tr":"alam","en":"Did not"},{"ar":"أَقُل","tr":"aqul","en":"I tell","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَّكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"you"},{"ar":"لَوْلَا","tr":"lawlā","en":"'Why not"},{"ar":"تُسَبِّحُونَ","tr":"tusabbiḥūna","en":"you glorify (Allah)?'","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"}]},{"n":29,"juz":29,"ar":"قَالُوا۟ سُبْحَـٰنَ رَبِّنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en":"They said, \"Exalted is our Lord! Indeed, we were wrongdoers.\"","w":[{"ar":"قَالُوا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"They said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","tr":"sub'ḥāna","en":"Glory be","root":"سبح","lem":"سُبْحان"},{"ar":"رَبِّنَآ","tr":"rabbinā","en":"(to) our Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, we"},{"ar":"كُنَّا","tr":"kunnā","en":"[we] were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"ظَـٰلِمِينَ","tr":"ẓālimīna","en":"wrongdoers","root":"ظلم","lem":"ظالِم"}]},{"n":30,"juz":29,"ar":"فَأَقْبَلَ بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ يَتَلَـٰوَمُونَ","en":"Then they approached one another, blaming each other.","w":[{"ar":"فَأَقْبَلَ","tr":"fa-aqbala","en":"Then approached","root":"قبل","lem":"أَقْبَلَ"},{"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","tr":"baʿḍuhum","en":"some of them","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"to"},{"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ","tr":"baʿḍin","en":"others"