":"(of) the Hereafter","root":"أخر","lem":"آخِر"},{"ar":"أَكْبَرُ ۚ","tr":"akbaru","en":"(is) greater","root":"كبر","lem":"أَكْبَر"},{"ar":"لَوْ","tr":"law","en":"if"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"yaʿlamūna","en":"know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"}]},{"n":34,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنَّ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Indeed, for the righteous with their Lord are the Gardens of Pleasure.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","tr":"lil'muttaqīna","en":"for the righteous","root":"وقي","lem":"مُتَّقي"},{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"with","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"جَنَّـٰتِ","tr":"jannāti","en":"(are) Gardens","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","tr":"l-naʿīmi","en":"(of) Delight","root":"نعم","lem":"نَعِيم"}]},{"n":35,"juz":29,"ar":"أَفَنَجْعَلُ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ كَٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en":"Then will We treat the Muslims like the criminals?","w":[{"ar":"أَفَنَجْعَلُ","tr":"afanajʿalu","en":"Then will We treat","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","tr":"l-mus'limīna","en":"the Muslims","root":"سلم","lem":"مُسْلِم"},{"ar":"كَٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","tr":"kal-muj'rimīna","en":"like the criminals","root":"جرم","lem":"مُجْرِم"}]},{"n":36,"juz":29,"ar":"مَا لَكُمْ كَيْفَ تَحْكُمُونَ","en":"What is [the matter] with you? How do you judge?","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"What"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"(is) for you"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"How","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"تَحْكُمُونَ","tr":"taḥkumūna","en":"(do) you judge","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكَمَ"}]},{"n":37,"juz":29,"ar":"أَمْ لَكُمْ كِتَـٰبٌ فِيهِ تَدْرُسُونَ","en":"Or do you have a scripture in which you learn","w":[{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"Or"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"(is) for you"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبٌۭ","tr":"kitābun","en":"a book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"