"en":"Or do they have partners? Then let them bring their partners, if they should be truthful.","w":[{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"Or"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"(are) for them"},{"ar":"شُرَكَآءُ","tr":"shurakāu","en":"partners","root":"شرك","lem":"شَرِيك"},{"ar":"فَلْيَأْتُوا۟","tr":"falyatū","en":"Then let them bring","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"بِشُرَكَآئِهِمْ","tr":"bishurakāihim","en":"their partners","root":"شرك","lem":"شَرِيك"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","tr":"ṣādiqīna","en":"truthful","root":"صدق","lem":"صادِق"}]},{"n":42,"juz":29,"ar":"يَوْمَ يُكْشَفُ عَن سَاقٍ وَيُدْعَوْنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ فَلَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","en":"The Day the shin will be uncovered and they are invited to prostration but they [i.e., the disbelievers] will not be able,","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(The) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يُكْشَفُ","tr":"yuk'shafu","en":"will be uncovered","root":"كشف","lem":"كَشَفَ"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"سَاقٍۢ","tr":"sāqin","en":"the shin","root":"سوق","lem":"ساق"},{"ar":"وَيُدْعَوْنَ","tr":"wayud'ʿawna","en":"and they will be called","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","tr":"l-sujūdi","en":"prostrate","root":"سجد","lem":"سُجُود"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"but not"},{"ar":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","tr":"yastaṭīʿūna","en":"they will be able","root":"طوع","lem":"اسْتَطاعَ"}]},{"n":43,"juz":29,"ar":"خَـٰشِعَةً أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ تَرْهَقُهُمْ ذِلَّةٌ ۖ وَقَدْ كَانُوا۟ يُدْعَوْنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ وَهُمْ سَـٰلِمُونَ","en":"Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. And they used to be invited to prostration while they were sound.","w":[{"ar":"خَـٰشِعَةً","tr":"khāshiʿatan","en":"Humbled","root":"خشع","lem":"خاشِع"},{"ar":"أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ","tr":"abṣāruhum","en":"their eyes","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصَر"},{"ar":"تَرْهَقُهُمْ","tr":"tarhaquhum","en":"will cover them","roo