led out","root":"ندي","lem":"نادَى"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"while he"},{"ar":"مَكْظُومٌۭ","tr":"makẓūmun","en":"(was) distressed","root":"كظم","lem":"مَكْظُوم"}]},{"n":49,"juz":29,"ar":"لَّوْلَآ أَن تَدَٰرَكَهُۥ نِعْمَةٌ مِّن رَّبِّهِۦ لَنُبِذَ بِٱلْعَرَآءِ وَهُوَ مَذْمُومٌ","en":"If not that a favor [i.e., mercy] from his Lord overtook him, he would have been thrown onto the naked shore while he was censured.","w":[{"ar":"لَّوْلَآ","tr":"lawlā","en":"If not"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"تَدَٰرَكَهُۥ","tr":"tadārakahu","en":"overtook him","root":"درك","lem":"ادّارَكَ"},{"ar":"نِعْمَةٌۭ","tr":"niʿ'matun","en":"a Favor","root":"نعم","lem":"نِعْمَة"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّهِۦ","tr":"rabbihi","en":"his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"لَنُبِذَ","tr":"lanubidha","en":"surely he would have been thrown","root":"نبذ","lem":"نَبَذَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلْعَرَآءِ","tr":"bil-ʿarāi","en":"onto (the) naked shore","root":"عري","lem":"عَراء"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"while he"},{"ar":"مَذْمُومٌۭ","tr":"madhmūmun","en":"(was) blamed","root":"ذمم","lem":"مَذْمُوم"}]},{"n":50,"juz":29,"ar":"فَٱجْتَبَـٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَجَعَلَهُۥ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en":"And his Lord chose him and made him of the righteous.","w":[{"ar":"فَٱجْتَبَـٰهُ","tr":"fa-ij'tabāhu","en":"But chose him","root":"جبي","lem":"اجْتَبَى"},{"ar":"رَبُّهُۥ","tr":"rabbuhu","en":"his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ","tr":"fajaʿalahu","en":"and made him","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","tr":"l-ṣāliḥīna","en":"the righteous","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِح"}]},{"n":51,"juz":29,"ar":"وَإِن يَكَادُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَيُزْلِقُونَكَ بِأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ لَمَّا سَمِعُوا۟ ٱلذِّكْرَ وَيَقُولُونَ إِنَّهُۥ لَمَجْنُونٌ","en":"And indeed, those who disbelieve would almost make you slip with their eyes [i.e., looks] when they hear the message, and they say, \"Indeed, he is mad.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"And indeed"},{"ar":"يَكَادُ","tr":"yakādu","en":"would almost","root":"كود","lem":"كادَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"لَيُزْلِقُونَكَ","tr":"layuz'liqūnaka","en":"surely make you slip","root":"زلق","lem":"يُزْلِقُ"},{"ar":"بِأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ","tr":"bi-abṣārihim","en":"with their look","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصَر"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"سَمِعُوا۟","tr":"samiʿū","en":"they hear","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرَ","tr":"l-dhik'ra","en":"the Message","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْر"},{"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","tr":"wayaqūlūna","en":"and they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, he"},{"ar":"لَمَجْنُونٌۭ","tr":"lamajnūnun","en":"(is) surely mad","root":"جنن","lem":"مَجْنُون"}]},{"n":52,"juz":29,"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en":"But it is not except a reminder to the worlds.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it (is)"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"but"},{"ar":"ذِكْرٌۭ","tr":"dhik'run","en":"a Reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْر"},{"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tr":"lil'ʿālamīna","en":"to the worlds","root":"علم","lem":"عالَم"}]}]}